      "name": "Mohsin",
      "created_at": "2022-04-22T10:53:24.530Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, I’m trying to hide a field in the Quotation doctype called customer_name of type Data. It’s not mandatory and it’s read-only.</p>\n<p>I checked ‘Hidden’ in the Customize Form but doesn’t work.</p>\n<p>I wrote a script to hide but also didn’t hide.<br>\nAll fields can be hidden except this</p>\n<pre><code>frappe.ui.form.on('Quotation', {\n\nrefresh: function (frm) {\n\n    //hide customer_name field always on loading page\n    frm.toggle_display(\"customer_name\", true); \n})\n</code></pre>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/8/a88c66fcae31fe89e5411ee9b5d38d343546fa61.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a88c66fcae31fe89e5411ee9b5d38d343546fa61\" title=\"1\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a88c66fcae31fe89e5411ee9b5d38d343546fa61_2_690x350.png\" alt=\"1\" data-base62-sha1=\"o331AfV65pvjuBCvXR7brPQm5bP\" width=\"690\" height=\"350\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a88c66fcae31fe89e5411ee9b5d38d343546fa61_2_690x350.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a88c66fcae31fe89e5411ee9b5d38d343546fa61_2_1035x525.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a88c66fcae31fe89e5411ee9b5d38d343546fa61_2_1380x700.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">1</span><span class=\"informations\">1449×737 27.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/f/1fb9ab543d8715f0db70324bb48bceedf7b443f7.png\" alt=\"2\" data-base62-sha1=\"4wEAXvB6neaLBlcgDyJsItPlmUD\" width=\"638\" height=\"284\"></p>",
