      "created_at": "2022-04-22T11:01:40.838Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mohsin1990\">@Mohsin1990</a>,</p>\n<p>Please apply and check it.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">frappe.ui.form.on(\"Quotation\",{\n   refresh(frm){\n       frm.toggle_display(\"customer_name\", false);\n   }\n});\n</code></pre>\n<p>Thank You!</p>",
